# Ignore everything. Allow only the files this project tracks.
# Pattern: Alex Pliutau, ".gitignore everything by default",
#   https://pliutau.com/git-ignore-everything-by-default/
#
# Git cannot re-include a file if a parent directory is excluded
# (gitignore(5), https://git-scm.com/docs/gitignore#_notes).
# Allow each directory before its files. A new directory stays
# ignored until it has its own lines here.
*

!/.gitignore
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/deps.edn

!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/workflows/*.yml

!/examples/
!/examples/Info.plist
!/examples/glimmer_uikit/
!/examples/glimmer_uikit/*.clj

!/scripts/
!/scripts/bundle

!/src/
!/src/glimmer_uikit/
!/src/glimmer_uikit/*.clj

!/test/
!/test/glimmer_uikit/
!/test/glimmer_uikit/*.clj
